<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/Guz/dict/koch/1> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "घुष् /ghuṣ/ (U. pr. /ghoṣati/ /ghoṣate/ — I- fut. /ghoṣiṣyati/ /ghoṣiṣyate/- pf. /jughoṣa/ /jughuṣe/- aor. /aghoṣīt/ /aghoṣiṣṭa/- pp. /ghu-ṣita/, /ghoṣita/, /ghuṣṭa/) 1) звучать 2) кричать 3) объявлять"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "koch" .

<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/Guz/dict/kna/2> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "घुष्\t/ghuṣ/\t/ghuS/\t/гхуш/\tghuṣ (ghōṣati, pp. ghuṣṭa) кричать, провозглашать.\tс. 219"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "kna" .

